1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,967
One student. 60 supervision enquiries.

2
00:00:03,967 --> 00:00:07,933
Prepared mail, a roster and four PDFs.

3
00:00:07,933 --> 00:00:11,867
Classify mail, roster and attachment sources.

4
00:00:11,867 --> 00:00:15,800
Inspect the detected role before continuing.

5
00:00:15,800 --> 00:00:19,733
Different formats. One normalized task schema.

6
00:00:19,733 --> 00:00:23,667
Keep recipient, subject, body and file requirements linked.

7
00:00:23,667 --> 00:00:27,600
Cross-check each recipient against the reference roster.

8
00:00:27,600 --> 00:00:31,533
Different people at one university stay separate.

9
00:00:31,533 --> 00:00:35,467
Review the batch. Open any mail in place.

10
00:00:35,467 --> 00:00:39,400
Keep subjects and bodies specific to the research direction.

11
00:00:39,400 --> 00:00:43,333
Resolve filenames against each mail's requirements.

12
00:00:43,333 --> 00:00:47,267
Four source files fulfil 211 attachment requirements.

13
00:00:47,267 --> 00:00:51,200
Set the recipient's local send time.

14
00:00:51,200 --> 00:00:55,133
Limit each institution to one enquiry per day.

15
00:00:55,133 --> 00:00:59,067
Keep at least seven days between colleagues.

16
00:00:59,067 --> 00:01:03,000
60 enquiries resolve into 15 send dates.

17
00:01:03,000 --> 00:01:06,933
Freeze the 60 selected tasks before execution.

18
00:01:06,933 --> 00:01:10,867
Pass content and file references through Chrome runtime.

19
00:01:10,867 --> 00:01:14,800
Verify attachments. Confirm each draft save.

20
00:01:14,800 --> 00:01:18,733
A revised proposal affects 59 scheduled drafts.

21
00:01:18,733 --> 00:01:22,667
Read. Clone. Replace. Verify. Then swap.

22
00:01:22,667 --> 00:01:26,600
Preserve recipients, body, subject and scheduled time.

23
00:01:26,600 --> 00:01:28,567
59 replacements verified. Clean up the source draft.

24
00:01:28,567 --> 00:01:32,500
Later, sync sent-mail and inbox history.

25
00:01:32,500 --> 00:01:36,433
Eight human replies move to manual handling.

26
00:01:36,433 --> 00:01:40,367
52 contacts remain eligible for follow-up.

27
00:01:40,367 --> 00:01:42,333
Select only contacts whose next step is due.
